--------Dependency Array---------

The dependency array controls when the effect runs.

Case 1
useEffect(() => {
  console.log("Run");
});

Runs on every render.

Case 2
useEffect(() => {
  console.log("Run");
}, []);

Runs only once.

Case 3
useEffect(() => {
  console.log("Run");
}, [count]);

Runs whenever count changes.

Case 4
useEffect(() => {
  console.log("Run");
}, [count, name]);

Runs when either count or name changes.





