Why []?
Component Loads
      ↓
API Called Once
      ↓
Data Stored
      ↓
Component Re-rendered

Without [], the API would be called repeatedly.

Cleanup Function

Used to clean resources when component unmounts.

Syntax:

useEffect(() => {
  return () => {
    // cleanup
  };
}, []);




